          "_label": "descriptive note"
        }
      ],
      "content": "Lignum aloes / aloeswood / agalloch: the fragrant wood of the agalloch, from East Indian Aloexylon and Aquilaria species (OED s.v. aloe; Heyd 557-8, Pegolotti 412, Stieda 95), used medicinally and as incense. Distinct from the purgative drug aloes (see aloes) and from lignum vitae."
    }
